OL,3,ASeven arrested for using Ghanaian
OL,4,Abanknotes to make 'money bouquets'
OL,5,
OL,6,FGhanaian authorities have arrested
OL,7,Fseven people for allegedly using
OL,8,Fbanknotes to make so-called "money
OL,9,Fbouquets" and decorate cakes.
OL,11,FThe Bank of Ghana says the practice is
OL,12,Fillegal and amounts to misuse and
OL,13,Fimproper handling of the cedi, the
OL,14,Fnational currency.
OL,16,FThe arrests, carried out in
OL,17,Fcollaboration with the police, followed
OL,18,Fa tip-off that led to a swoop on the
OL,19,Fsuspects, all women, accused of selling
OL,20,Fthe bouquets in different parts of the
OL,21,Fcapital, Accra.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
