OL,3,ASeven arrested for using Ghanaian
OL,4,Abanknotes to make 'money bouquets'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe arrests are the biggest enforcement
OL,7,Fof the law against misusing the
OL,8,Fcurrency. In July, the bank issued a
OL,9,Fnotice warning this could amount to an
OL,10,Foffence.
